# Audit notes — exp-backtest-1-muse bound to d7f0463ae132ca62ac88c0ae43f97fac45c770e4

Lessons:
- Findings-machine exps grade on legibility, not pass: corpus counts, per-tape traces, and findings with fix targets are the artifact; lifecycle without InitRecord stays ungradeable.
- Ledger truth lives on the exp branch (ledger.jsonl/state.yaml via git show), not the worktree; the stamped submit line is the env-preset evidence.
- Rung 3 matters: re-running harness.sh and a small backtest corpus confirmed the committed replay without reading whole session tapes.

